---
/**
 * An author's note, on paper — not a dark band. Credentials stated flatly for
 * the skeptic, warmth second. The portrait and the book cover sit as
 * captioned plates hanging toward the right margin.
 */
---

<section class="teacher-section grain" id="teacher" aria-labelledby="teacher-heading">
	<div class="sheet">
		<span class="label-caps sheet-margin">The teacher</span>

		<div class="teacher-layout sheet-wide">
			<div class="teacher-copy">
				<h2 id="teacher-heading" class="teacher-heading">Led by Charlie Awbery</h2>

				<p>
					Charlie spent twenty-five years studying, practicing, and teaching Vajrayana, a
					life-affirming Buddhist path. They cofounded
					<a href="https://www.evolvingground.org/" rel="noreferrer">Evolving Ground</a>, a
					community of contemporary practice, and wrote
					<a href="https://www.evolvingground.org/opening-awareness" rel="noreferrer"
						><cite>Opening Awareness</cite></a
					>
					(2023), about the meditation this course teaches. These days they also teach meditation with
					tech founders and AI researchers operating at the frontier of artificial intelligence.
				</p>
				<p>
					In the course, Charlie guides with a steady, companionable presence. Sometimes you'll get
					clear instruction, or perhaps experiments to try or new things to notice. You get both
					clear, rooted instruction, and broad context into how this method works. They stay close
					and responsive, offering simple pointers that help you notice what's already present.
				</p>
				<p class="teacher-provenance">
					The method is a contemporary adaptation of a practice with centuries of history in Tibetan
					traditions. The course is in plain, practical English throughout.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="teacher-media">
				<figure class="teacher-figure">
					<div class="teacher-portrait plate">
						<img
							src="/images/charlie.jpeg"
							alt="Portrait of Charlie Awbery"
							loading="eager"
							fetchpriority="low"
							decoding="async"
							width="2988"
							height="2508"
						/>
					</div>
					<figcaption class="caption">Charlie Awbery</figcaption>
				</figure>

				<figure class="teacher-figure">
					<a
						class="book-plate plate"
						href="https://www.evolvingground.org/opening-awareness"
						rel="noreferrer"
						aria-label="Opening Awareness, the book, at Evolving Ground"
					>
						<img
							src="/images/opening-awareness-cover.jpg"
							alt="Cover of Opening Awareness by Charlie Awbery"
							loading="eager"
							fetchpriority="low"
							decoding="async"
							width="348"
							height="522"
						/>
					</a>
					<figcaption class="caption">
						The book this course grows from: a guide to finding vividness in spacious clarity.
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</div>

		<figure class="book-quote">
			<blockquote>
				This is a path of celebration, of down-to-earth realism, of uplifting courage, of gentle
				precision, and of open hearts.
			</blockquote>
			<figcaption>— <cite>Opening Awareness</cite> (2023)</figcaption>
		</figure>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.teacher-section {
		background: var(--surface);
		padding: clamp(3.5rem, 5vw + 1rem, 6.5rem) 0;
	}

	.teacher-layout {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, var(--measure)) minmax(10rem, 13rem);
		gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.teacher-heading {
		font-size: var(--fs-h2);
		font-weight: 390;
		letter-spacing: -0.018em;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin: 0 0 clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 2rem);
	}

	.teacher-copy p {
		font-size: var(--fs-body);
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
	}

	.teacher-copy p:first-of-type {
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.teacher-copy a {
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, transparent);
		text-underline-offset: 0.16em;
		transition: text-decoration-color 180ms ease;
	}

	.teacher-copy a:hover {
		text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.teacher-provenance {
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.teacher-media {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.teacher-figure {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.teacher-portrait {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
	}

	.teacher-portrait img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 28%;
	}

	.book-plate {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 11rem;
	}

	.book-plate img {
		width: 100%;
		display: block;
	}

	.book-quote {
		margin: clamp(3rem, 4vw + 1rem, 5rem) 0 0;
		max-width: 44rem;
	}

	.book-quote blockquote {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.05rem + 1.6vw, 2.1rem);
		line-height: 1.4;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		color: var(--ink);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.book-quote figcaption {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--fs-metadata);
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}

	@media (max-width: 52rem) {
		.teacher-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.teacher-media {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 11rem));
			align-items: start;
		}
	}
</style>
